      "reviewNotes": [
        "All 44 paper pages and all 22 native scheme pages visually swept. Paper pages 13, 23, 25 and 29 contain only continuation working grids; pages 41–43 additional work and page 44 the back cover. Scheme solutions occupy PDF pages 6–17, general modelling-project rubrics pages 18–20, blank page 21 and back cover 22.",
